Title: F1-M05 — Paper Wolves (briefing)
Credit: Staalfront
Author: Staalfront narrative team
Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. FORWARD COMMAND POST - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

MIRA
(serious)
Aerial photographs show a command post with a wall of guns. The detail is too perfect. It may be a stage set.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(measured)
They want us to spend shells on empty ground. Find the supply office that supports the display.

MIRA
(firm)
Use the captured markings if you can. Confirm the real target, then strike it.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
